            "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/731650/extras/11641a332ae1ecfeedb846aa7fdff8cc.webp?t=1793721228\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/731650/extras_big/11641a332ae1ecfeedb846aa7fdff8cc.webp?t=1793721228 width=800 height=27 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Criar um número quase infinito de mapas com diferentes sementes. Uma ilha, várias ou o modo Ilhas de Verão. Desde pequenos mapas 100x100 até 1500x1500 mapas. A partir de altas montanhas ou apenas ilhas de areia. Toda a gente encontra a sua pequena ilha no vasto oceano ou nos grandes arquipélagos. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/731650/extras/9dd49223a6ea440d99988eb73a34fed4.poster.avif?t=1793721228\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/731650/extras/9dd49223a6ea440d99988eb73a34fed4.webm?t=1793721228\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/731650/extras/9dd49223a6ea440d99988eb73a34fed4.mp4?t=1793721228\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/731650/extras/6b6d7b387de104d8a62df5b0f287e0af.webp?t=1793721228\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/731650/extras_big/6b6d7b387de104d8a62df5b0f287e0af.webp?t=1793721228 width=800 height=27 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Construir cabanas, vilas ou hotéis caros directamente na praia ou nas montanhas. Quando um edifício está terminado, os turistas podem vir de barco ou de avião. Os turistas querem ser preservados. Construir bares, discotecas, campos de golfe, supermercados e muitos outros edifícios que são populares entre os turistas e que o tornarão rico como proprietário. <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/731650/extras/261982926f3308acc638f4ee380f2234.poster.avif?t=1793721228\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/731650/extras/261982926f3308acc638f4ee380f2234.webm?t=1793721228\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/731650/extras/261982926f3308acc638f4ee380f2234.mp4?t=1793721228\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/731650/extras/cfad583d86a015805f1a81b748f85808.webp?t=1793721228\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/731650/extras_big/cfad583d86a015805f1a81b748f85808.webp?t=1793721228 width=800 height=27 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compre edifícios novos a partir de uma vasta gama de tipos de edifícios. Desde casas e hotéis a restaurantes, lojas, parques de atracções, etc. Aqui podes distinguir entre turistas de massa e turistas de luxo. Os edifícios com turistas de luxo dão-te mais dinheiro, mas são caros e têm uma capacidade inferior. Nota também que os turistas de massa e os turistas de luxo têm preferências diferentes quanto aos edifícios que se encontram nas proximidades.  <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/731650/extras/9b3f93e12eec0c9a387a00ee9df091ee.poster.avif?t=1793721228\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/731650/extras/9b3f93e12eec0c9a387a00ee9df091ee.webm?t=1793721228\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/731650/extras/9b3f93e12eec0c9a387a00ee9df091ee.mp4?t=1793721228\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/731650/extras/3d3c47a422352bb7c7489282251850a1.webp?t=1793721228\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/731650/extras_big/3d3c47a422352bb7c7489282251850a1.webp?t=1793721228 width=800 height=27 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Emprestar dinheiro emprestado ou pagar as suas dívidas. Saia e faça publicidade, ou subscreva um seguro. Verifique se os seus edifícios estão a ir bem e pode aumentar a renda. Contrate consultores para o proteger de sabotagem, por exemplo. Ou prefere desbloquear mais sabotagem? Isso depende inteiramente de si.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/731650/extras/d00255e9a0b3cafef9ffb9ef5a8095a1.poster.avif?t=1793721228\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/731650/extras/d00255e9a0b3cafef9ffb9ef5a8095a1.webm?t=1793721228\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/731650/extras/d00255e9a0b3cafef9ffb9ef5a8095a1.mp4?t=1793721228\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/731650/extras/eefdfec2c0142875a661a6ba848cfe89.webp?t=1793721228\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/731650/extras_big/eefdfec2c0142875a661a6ba848cfe89.webp?t=1793721228 width=800 height=27 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Infelizmente há também desastres naturais que podem destruir os seus edifícios. Seja tornado, terramoto ou meteorito, tudo é possível.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Em tempos calmos, a competição vem do vosso inimigo e expande-se sobre as vossas terras. Talvez haja algumas possibilidades de sabotagem! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/731650/extras/67db00029bc078ae626d056e6dd0dad1.poster.avif?t=1793721228\" width=616 height=294 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/731650/extras/67db00029bc078ae626d056e6dd0dad1.webm?t=1793721228\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/731650/extras/67db00029bc078ae626d056e6dd0dad1.mp4?t=1793721228\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/731650/extras/598e16ecb745efa6e6cecd6eb644acba.webp?t=1793721228\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/731650/extras_big/598e16ecb745efa6e6cecd6eb644acba.webp?t=1793721228 width=800 height=27 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No Editor de Mapas não só pode criar o seu mapa perfeito. Pode também preenchê-lo com eventos. Que edifícios devem ser desbloqueados e em que condições. Uma correspondência onde não possa construir estradas ou onde não haja minimapa? Quer que as catástrofes naturais ocorram sob certas condições num determinado local? Experimente-o! <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/731650/extras/954f4322f493d9a74ba3bf502c33ccc0.poster.avif?t=1793721228\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/731650/extras/954f4322f493d9a74ba3bf502c33ccc0.webm?t=1793721228\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/731650/extras/954f4322f493d9a74ba3bf502c33ccc0.mp4?t=1793721228\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
            "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/731650/extras/11641a332ae1ecfeedb846aa7fdff8cc.webp?t=1793721228\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/731650/extras_big/11641a332ae1ecfeedb846aa7fdff8cc.webp?t=1793721228 width=800 height=27 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Criar um número quase infinito de mapas com diferentes sementes. Uma ilha, várias ou o modo Ilhas de Verão. Desde pequenos mapas 100x100 até 1500x1500 mapas. A partir de altas montanhas ou apenas ilhas de areia. Toda a gente encontra a sua pequena ilha no vasto oceano ou nos grandes arquipélagos. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/731650/extras/9dd49223a6ea440d99988eb73a34fed4.poster.avif?t=1793721228\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/731650/extras/9dd49223a6ea440d99988eb73a34fed4.webm?t=1793721228\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/731650/extras/9dd49223a6ea440d99988eb73a34fed4.mp4?t=1793721228\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/731650/extras/6b6d7b387de104d8a62df5b0f287e0af.webp?t=1793721228\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/731650/extras_big/6b6d7b387de104d8a62df5b0f287e0af.webp?t=1793721228 width=800 height=27 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Construir cabanas, vilas ou hotéis caros directamente na praia ou nas montanhas. Quando um edifício está terminado, os turistas podem vir de barco ou de avião. Os turistas querem ser preservados. Construir bares, discotecas, campos de golfe, supermercados e muitos outros edifícios que são populares entre os turistas e que o tornarão rico como proprietário. <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/731650/extras/261982926f3308acc638f4ee380f2234.poster.avif?t=1793721228\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/731650/extras/261982926f3308acc638f4ee380f2234.webm?t=1793721228\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/731650/extras/261982926f3308acc638f4ee380f2234.mp4?t=1793721228\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/731650/extras/cfad583d86a015805f1a81b748f85808.webp?t=1793721228\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/731650/extras_big/cfad583d86a015805f1a81b748f85808.webp?t=1793721228 width=800 height=27 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compre edifícios novos a partir de uma vasta gama de tipos de edifícios. Desde casas e hotéis a restaurantes, lojas, parques de atracções, etc. Aqui podes distinguir entre turistas de massa e turistas de luxo. Os edifícios com turistas de luxo dão-te mais dinheiro, mas são caros e têm uma capacidade inferior. Nota também que os turistas de massa e os turistas de luxo têm preferências diferentes quanto aos edifícios que se encontram nas proximidades.  <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/731650/extras/9b3f93e12eec0c9a387a00ee9df091ee.poster.avif?t=1793721228\" width=800 height=450 ><source src