            "reviews": {
                "query_summary": {
                    "num_reviews": 1,
                    "review_score": 6,
                    "review_score_desc": "Mostly Positive",
                    "total_positive": 67,
                    "total_negative": 21,
                    "total_reviews": 88
                },
                "reviews": [
                    {
                        "recommendationid": "237836588",
                        "author": {
                            "steamid": "76561198091510237",
                            "num_reviews": 2,
                            "playtime_forever": 849,
                            "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0,
                            "playtime_at_review": 566,
                            "last_played": 1792874000
                        },
                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "I bought this game as a huge fan of Holiday Island, and somehow I ended up going back and playing the 1996 version instead...\nThis game is beautiful and a great throwback to the genre, BUT I simply can't play it without constant stutters and frame drops, sometimes all the way down to 25 FPS just from moving around the map. Meanwhile, I can run Cyberpunk on max settings with ray tracing without issues.\n\nThere is clearly something wrong with the optimization that absolutely butchers the performance. I just want smooth gameplay. I haven't even managed to reach 5,000 tourists yet because the constant stuttering completely ruins the experience for me.\nI'll never refund an indie game like this because I really want to support the developers, but at the moment I just can't keep playing.\nSuch a shame, because the game itself is genuinely beautiful and simple !",
                        "timestamp_created": 1792141647,
                        "timestamp_updated": 1792141647,
                        "voted_up": false,
                        "votes_up": 0,
                        "votes_funny": 0,
                        "weighted_vote_score": 0.5,
                        "comment_count": 1,
                        "steam_purchase": true,
                        "received_for_free": false,
                        "written_during_early_access": false,
                        "developer_response": "Thanks for the honest feedback—and for the much-needed kick in the pants. \nYou’re right: a beautiful game isn’t much fun if it keeps stuttering.\n\nWe’ve already put together an experimental beta called unstableNextVersion, which you can access through the game’s Steam → Properties → Betas menu. It’s still a work in progress, with around 40 bugs and features we’re still working on, so please keep that in mind—but early results are promising. \nOne of our friends has already reached one million tourists on this version.\n\nhave a look at the forumpost: https://steamcommunity.com/app/731650/discussions/0/572678133316094842/\n\nIf you feel like giving it a try, we’d love to hear whether performance is any better on your system. In the Steamforum or via Mail: SupportSummerIslands@marttalin.de\n\nAnd if the update eventually improves your experience, we’d be grateful if you considered updating your review—but absolutely no pressure. \n\nThanks again for supporting the game and taking the time to tell us what’s wrong!\nBest regards\nMatt",
                        "timestamp_dev_responded": 1792176575,
                        "primarily_steam_deck": false,
                        "refunded": false
                    }
                ],
